---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="bg-white shadow-md rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-8">
      <div class="bg-blue-600 h-48 flex items-center justify-center">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white">关于我们</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 md:p-8">
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          欢迎来到我们的网站！我们是一个充满激情的团队，致力于为用户提供最好的体验。我们的使命是通过创新和卓越的设计，为用户创造有价值的内容和服务。
        </p>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4">我们的愿景</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          我们希望通过我们的产品和服务，改变人们与技术互动的方式。我们相信，好的设计不仅仅是外观美观，更重要的是能够解决实际问题，提升用户体验。
        </p>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4">我们的团队</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8">
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-32 h-32 rounded-full bg-gray-300 mx-auto mb-4 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="text-gray-600 text-5xl">👩</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-800">张小明</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">创始人 &amp; CEO</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-32 h-32 rounded-full bg-gray-300 mx-auto mb-4 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="text-gray-600 text-5xl">👨</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-800">李小华</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">首席技术官</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-32 h-32 rounded-full bg-gray-300 mx-auto mb-4 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="text-gray-600 text-5xl">👩</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-800">王小红</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">设计总监</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4">联系我们</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-2">如果您有任何问题或建议，请随时联系我们：</p>
        <ul class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed list-disc pl-5 mb-6">
          <li>电子邮件：info@example.com</li>
          <li>电话：(123) 456-7890</li>
          <li>地址：某某市某某区某某街道123号</li>
        </ul>
        
        <div class="flex justify-center">
          <a href="/contact" class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-md font-medium transition-colors duration-200">联系我们</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>